WEBVTT

30:30.730 --> 30:35.110
- What did Lord Arryn want?
- He always came to see the boy.

30:35.235 --> 30:39.406
- I'd like to see him as well.
- As you wish, my lord.

30:39.531 --> 30:41.408
Gendry!

30:45.036 --> 30:46.496
Here he is.

30:46.621 --> 30:49.582
Strong for his age.
He works hard.

30:50.458 --> 30:52.544
Show the Hand
the helmet you made, lad.
